 ep dive into the work of some of the region’s most talented First People
 s artists and designers. Using clothing as a canvas for storytelling\, thi
 s exciting collaboration will connect audiences with the rich and diverse 
 cultural expressions of First Peoples communities in Queensland and beyond
 .
