UID:brisbane-1957zka@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260913T090000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260913T110000
SUMMARY:Horizon of Khufu: Journey in Ancient Egypt
DESCRIPTION:⭐ The Pyramids of Egypt have arrived in Brisbane for the firs
 t time ! This immersive and groundbreaking expedition takes you back to th
 e golden age of ancient Egypt\, allowing you to explore the depths of the 
 iconic pyramids\, meet the goddess Bastet\, observe the embalming ceremony
  of Khufu\, and much more! Embark on a journey to the past already experie
 nced by more than 1 million people with the Horizon of Khufu! Highlights 
 📜 The largest immersive expedition of its kind dedicated to ancient Egy
 pt 🧭 Travel back of 4500 years in time to the heart of ancient Egypt 
 🏆 Over 2.5+ million visitors worldwide 😎 Move freely through the Gre
 at Pyramid of Giza in a fully immersive virtual reality experience 🔎 En
 ter forbidden corridors\, uncover the mysteries of the Queen’s Chamber\,
  and meet the goddess Bastet 👨‍👩‍👧‍👧 Enjoy an intimate a
 nd educational experience designed especially for small groups 🌟 Develo
 ped in collaboration with Egyptologist Peter der Manuelian from Harvard Un
 iversity 🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card here 
 General Info 📅 Date: from March 2026 ⏳ Duration: approx. 1 hour\, inc
 luding 45 minutes of immersion walking 📍 Location: Fever Immersive Cent
 er - Level 1\, 123 Gotha St\, Fortitude Valley QLD 👤 Age requirement: 1
 0+ with a minimum height of 1.30m (anyone aged 10-15 must be accompanied b
 y an adult\; anyone between 15-17 attending without an adult must bring a 
 pre-signed waiver form) ♿ Accessibility: the venue is wheelchair accessi
 ble\, but electric wheelchairs must switch to manual mode or alternatively
  use our manual wheelchairs onsite ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this exp
 erience here Description Put on your virtual reality headset and fasten yo
 ur seatbelt! In Horizon of Khufu \, travel thousands of years back to the 
 heart of ancient Egypt. Discover the secrets of one of the seven wonders o
 f the world through an innovative concept: the immersive expedition. Explo
 re the Great Pyramid of Giza as it was more than 4500 years ago. Walk thro
 ugh its mysterious corridors\, enter the Queen’s Chamber\, and even try 
 to meet the goddess Bastet\, in a unique experience in Brisbane. Ready to 
 discover how people lived during Egypt’s 4th Dynasty? Get your tickets n
 ow for Horizon of Khufu: Journey to Ancient Egypt in Brisbane!
LOCATION:Fever Immersive Center in Brisbane
URL:https://feverup.com/m/558113
END:VEVENT
