BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:brisbane-g64h8z@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260917T050000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260917T080000
SUMMARY:PETER MORÉN (Peter Bjorn And John\, SunYears\, Robert Forster’s 
 band etc) intimate solo show! plus THE STIRLING CANON
DESCRIPTION:PETER MORÉN (Peter Bjorn And John\, SunYears\, Robert Forsters
  band etc) intimate solosshow! Peter Morén is the lead singer and guitari
 st of Swedish indie-icons Peter Bjorn And John. He has previously toured A
 ustralia with them and played among other things Laneways Festival and Spl
 endor in the Grass. He's now coming back down under to be guitarist/backin
 g vocalist in Robert Forsters Swedish band (Peter produced his latest albu
 m "Strawberries" in Stockholm) and finds the time to do some intimate lowk
 ey solo dates while here. Peter has recently primarily worked with his two
  lauded album as SunYears (2023s "Come Fetch My Soul!" and 2025s "The Song
  Forlorn")\, sitting somewhere in between solowork/band. SunYears is drive
 n by Peter as a new angle and fresh start in personal songwriting after a 
 long life spent in music. With a variety of sonics ranging from wistful fo
 lk\, Beatles-esque harmonies\, psychedelic guitar jangle to shimmering bal
 ladry the melodic wisdom of SunYears on record has brought in guestvocals 
 from Ron Sexmith\, Fruit Bats\, Madison Cunningham\, Lisa Hanningan\, Nico
 le Atkins and more. SunYears recently played at the heralded Kilkenny Root
 s Festival\, Ireland. Peter Bjorn And John is currently touring behind the
  20th anniversary of their classic album "Writers Block" with dates in USA
 /Canada\, Mexico and Europe. Peter also recently released a collaborative 
 single with Josh Rouse and played guitar on James Yorkstons three latest a
 lbums. Live with just a guitar Peter is free to skip between SunYears mate
 rial\, covers of favorites and maybe the occasional Peter Bjorn And John-c
 lassic. No setlist and no boundaries! Opportunity knocks for a unique and 
 spontaneous evening! Don't miss out! Peter will be supported by The Stirli
 ng Canon\, young and keen and tremendous. [button link="https://events.hum
 anitix.com/peter-moren-and-the-stirling-canon"]Tickets[/button]
LOCATION:The Cave Inn\, 47 Balaclava St.\, Woolloongabba\, QLD\, 4102
URL:https://thecaveinn.net/events/peter-moren-peter-bjorn-and-john-sunyears
 -robert-forsters-band-etc-intimate-solo-show-plus-the-stirling-canon/
END:VEVENT
