UID:brisbane-w22qy4@dothings
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260703
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001
SUMMARY:NAIDOC 2026 Exhibition: Fifty Years of Deadly
DESCRIPTION:Curated by Margie Kennedy (COOEE Program Manager) this moving e
 xhibition is a visual truth telling that honours the past\, speaks to the 
 present and empowers the future\, through powerful images\, cultural conte
 nt and stories. Fifty Years of Deadly captures the strength of Elders\, th
 e vision of youth and the legacy that continues to shape their communities
 .
