BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:brisbane-x8kdip@dothings
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260923
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260928
SUMMARY:ESCAPE
DESCRIPTION:A boundary-breaking fusion of human movement and physical struc
 tures. DIAVOLO | Architecture in Motion® productions explore innovation a
 nd celebrate the complexity of the human condition with an undefinable ble
 nd of dance\, stunt work\, acrobatics\, circus arts\, and pedestrian movem
 ent. The work is athletic\, captivating\, and visceral. This is a show tha
 t will leave you breathless. Visceral and high-octane\, ESCAPE blends comp
 lex\, moving architectural structures with multi-talented performers to cr
 eate a blood-pumping and emotional multimedia experience. Along with DIAVO
 LO's signature athletic movement aesthetic\, ESCAPE features a collection 
 of the company's most famous architectural structures. Each evokes a story
  unique to its design\, echoing themes of exploration\, danger\, fear\, su
 rvival\, resilience\, and connection\, all brought to life through a sound
 track spanning decades and genres\, from pop and EDM to rock.
LOCATION:South Bank Parklands\, Grey St\, South Bank
URL:https://www.visitsouthbank.com.au/events/escape
END:VEVENT
