BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:brisbane-1smidl0@dothings
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260923
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260924
SUMMARY:Capturing Beauty – Solo show by Carol Oh
DESCRIPTION:[vc_row css=”.vc_custom_1523319263370{padding-top: 20px !impo
 rtant\;padding-bottom: 30px !important\;}”][vc_column][vc_separator colo
 r=”custom” border_width=”10″ accent_color=”#4ba686″][vc_column
 _text]Brisbane-based artist Carol Oh creates works in oil paint and pen th
 at celebrate the timeless beauty of the human form\, nature\, architecture
 \, and the quiet poetry of everyday life. Her diverse body of work encompa
 sses exquisite floral studies\, portraiture\, figurative subjects\, landsc
 apes\, and finely detailed pen drawings of Rome and its enduring architect
 ural splendour. Drawing and painting from a young age\, Carol has cultivat
 ed a lifelong passion for capturing beauty\, atmosphere\, and character. H
 er work reflects a deep appreciation for both the grandeur and subtlety fo
 und in the world around us. This exhibition\, Capturing Beauty\, brings to
 gether a collection of portraiture\, figurative\, floral\, and landscape w
 orks. Through her art\, Carol invites viewers into moments of reflection a
 nd connection\, creating evocative imagery that lingers in the memory and 
 resonates beyond the canvas. She continues to expand her artistic practice
  and welcomes commissioned work. Exhibition will be on show at RQAS Brisba
 ne Gallery from Wednesday\, 23rd of September to Sunday\, 27th of Septembe
 r.[/vc_column_text][vc_separator color=”custom” border_width=”10″ 
 accent_color=”#4ba686″][vc_single_image image=”26108″ img_size=”
 full”][/vc_column][/vc_row]
LOCATION:Petrie Terrace Gallery\, 3/162 Petrie Terrace
URL:https://rqas.com.au/event/carol-oh-2026-show/
END:VEVENT
