DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260914T103000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260914T123000
SUMMARY:Cruise To Lunch Package
DESCRIPTION:Tickets 🎫 Adult ticket for 1 (16-64) Each ticket includes : 
 Lunch All activities Driver/guide Live commentary on board Coffee and/or T
 ea Snacks Highlights 🛥️ Relax on a river cruise and enjoy a mouth-wat
 ering meal on this combo tour 📗 Learn about Brisbane’s history and cu
 lture from an informative guide 👓 Admire views of landmarks like Storey
  Bridge and Kangaroo Point Cliffs General Info 📅 Date: various dates (s
 elect when purchasing) 🕒 Time: 10:30am - 12:00pm 📌 Departure point: 
 Cultural Centre Public Pontoon ⏳ Duration: 3 hr 30 mins approx. 👤 Age
  requirement: 16+ with valid ID ❓ For this event\, all sales are final a
 nd tickets can’t be refunded\, changed or modified. For more information
 \, please refer to our T&Cs Description This cruise to lunch will let you 
 spend the day with two popular Brisbane identities\; River City Cruises an
 d the Breakfast Creek Hotel. Aboard the boat\, the sights will be accompan
 ied by informative commentary about the region as well as a morning tea to
  satisfy your on board cravings. The morning cruise will last for 45 minut
 es until you reach your next point of call\; the Breakfast Creek Hotel. Th
 e Breakfast Creek Hotel is a popular hotspot for locals and tourists alike
  and after a short walk from the landing dock\, it is where you can enjoy 
 a delicious meal. Plating up a range of dishes such as Rump steak\, Panko 
 Calamari and Caesar Salad\, it will be hard to leave the Hotel with a rumb
 ling stomach. From here you will once again board the MV Neptune to cruise
  back to the dock at South Bank within the luscious Parklands.
LOCATION:Cultural Centre Public Pontoon\, Cultural Centre Boardwalk\, South
  Brisbane QLD 4101\, Australia
URL:https://feverup.com/m/90090
END:VEVENT
