SUMMARY:Piano Man: Celebrating the Music of Billy Joel
DESCRIPTION:For more than 50 years\, American singer\, songwriter and piani
 st Billy Joel has made an indelible mark on the American songbook. With 33
  top 40 hits\, 5 Grammy Awards and over 160 million albums worldwide\, he 
 is one of the most successful artists of all time. This September at the B
 risbane Convention & Exhibition Centre\, QSO under the baton of Jessica Ge
 thin will celebrate Billy Joel in Piano Man. Directed by Mark Sutcliffe an
 d starring Phil Burton\, Alinta Chidzey\, Jess Hitchcock and Josh Piterman
 \, Piano Man features new orchestral arrangements by Nicholas Buc covering
  his greatest hits including Just the Way You Are\, She's Always a Woman\,
  New York State of Mind\, Only the Good Die Young\, Vienna and of course P
 iano Man. Featuring: Mark Sutcliffe director Nicholas Buc arranger Phil Bu
 rton vocalist Alinta Chidzey vocalist Jess Hitchcock vocalist Josh Piterma
 n vocalist *Please note: This concert does not feature Billy Joel in perso
 n. Piano Man is presented in association with Make My Mark.
LOCATION:South Bank Parklands\, Grey St\, South Bank
URL:https://www.visitsouthbank.com.au/events/piano-man-celebrating-the-musi
 c-of-billy-joel
