SUMMARY:Little Monsters
DESCRIPTION:Little Monsters is a ticketed event. A ticket must be bought fo
 r each adult and child attending. Each $10 ticket comes with a bag of 20 N
 etherworld tokens to be used during the session. Extra tokens can be purch
 ased as normal. These sessions are suitable for small family groups with c
 hildren 12 years and under. We’re often asked “Can I bring my tiny ter
 ror?” Our underworld policy is that because it can get a little gnarlier
  as the evening goes on\, we don’t allow little ones after 5pm. There’
 s creatures stuck in the wall that’ll swallow them whole if you’re not
  careful. To even that out\, we host ‘Little Monsters’ from 9.30am to 
 11.30am – a morning for guardians and monsters to be. The bar will be st
 ocked up with soda\, juice and something with less sugar because we’re n
 ot all monsters.Please note Netherworld will be closed between 11.30am and
  Midday. A Little Monsters FAQ Unfortunately during these sessions we cann
 ot cater to large gatherings or parties\, as the sessions are more focused
  on providing a more relaxed space outside of our regular hours for famili
 es to enjoy the games together. We don’t do any table bookings during th
 ese session – it’s very casual. The session runs from 9.30am to 11.30a
 m\, with a 15 minute heads up at 11.15am. We require the venue to be vacat
 ed at this time so that we can clean up and refresh the venue for our lunc
 htime open at midday.No outside food or drink is allowed. If your child ha
 s any dietry needs during this time that requires you bring your own food\
 , this is of course perfectly fine. If you have any questions whatsoever\,
  get in touch via info@netherworldarcade.com.
LOCATION:Netherworld\, 186 Brunswick Street
URL:https://www.netherworldarcade.com/event/little-monsters-6/
END:VEVENT
